<title>UK: Senior Engineering names chief executive.</title>
<headline>Senior Engineering names chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senior Engineering Group Plc said it has appointed Andrew Parrish as chief executive from January 1 1997.</p>
<p>He joins from Williams Holdings Plc, where he is currently divisional managing director responsible for Williams' international coatings and fillers businesses.  </p>
<p>Chairman Alan Watkins has been acting chief executive since the previous chief executive John Bell left the company at the end of January. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
